          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.33.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Num 33.40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " When the Canaanite, the king of Arad, who dwelt in the Negeb, heard that Israel was coming by the way of Atharim, he fought against Israel, and took some of them captive. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Israel vowed a vow to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and said, “If thou wilt indeed give this people into my hand, then I will utterly destroy their cities.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " hearkened to the voice of Israel, and gave over the Canaanites; and they utterly destroyed them and their cities; so the name of the place was called Hormah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21.3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Destruction",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From Mount Hor they set out by the way to the Red Sea, to go around the land of Edom; and the people became impatient on the way. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the people spoke against God and against Moses, “Why have you brought us up out of Egypt to die in the wilderness? For there is no food and no water, and we loathe this worthless food.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " sent fiery serpents among the people, and they bit the people, so that many people of Israel died. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the people came to Moses, and said, “We have sinned, for we have spoken against the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and against you; pray to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", that he take away the serpents from us.” So Moses prayed for the people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, “Make a fiery serpent, and set it on a pole; and every one who is bitten, when he sees it, shall live.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Moses made a bronze serpent, and set it on a pole; and if a serpent bit any man, he would look at the bronze serpent and live.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the people of Israel set out, and encamped in Oboth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Oboth, and encamped at Iyeabarim, in the wilderness which is opposite Moab, toward the sunrise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From there they set out, and encamped in the Valley of Zered. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From there they set out, and encamped on the other side of the Arnon, which is in the wilderness that extends from the boundary of the Amorites; for the Arnon is the boundary of Moab, between Moab and the Amorites. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherefore it is said in the Book of the Wars of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And from there they continued to Beer;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21.16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "That is",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Well",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " that is the well of which the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, “Gather the people together, and I will give them water.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Israel sang this song:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.2.26+DEU.2.27+DEU.2.28+DEU.2.29+DEU.2.30+DEU.2.31+DEU.2.32+DEU.2.33+DEU.2.34+DEU.2.35+DEU.2.36+DEU.2.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 2.26-37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Then Israel sent messengers to Sihon king of the Amorites, saying, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Let me pass through your land; we will not turn aside into field or vineyard; we will not drink the water of a well; we will go by the King's Highway, until we have passed through your territory.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Sihon would not allow Israel to pass through his territory. He gathered all his men together, and went out against Israel to the wilderness, and came to Jahaz, and fought against Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Israel slew him with the edge of the sword, and took possession of his land from the Arnon to the Jabbok, as far as to the Ammonites; for Jazer was the boundary of the Ammonites.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21.24",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "the boundary of the Ammonites was strong",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Israel took all these cities, and Israel settled in all the cities of the Amorites, in Heshbon, and in all its villages. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For Heshbon was the city of Sihon the king of the Amorites, who had fought against the former king of Moab and taken all his land out of his hand, as far as the Arnon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore the ballad singers say,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus Israel dwelt in the land of the Amorites. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.31"
            ]
